  "limitations": [
    "Only 5c1f436 -> c6883b0 is measured here. The later append_grapheme allocation helper is excluded.",
    "Alternate ran on AMD EPYC 7763; primary ran on AMD EPYC 9V74. The results are not pooled and the difference between profiles is not attributed solely to history.",
    "Five AB/BA pairs per profile; fixed within-sample workload order; all before/after ranges overlap in both profiles. No statistical significance or overall speedup claim.",
    "Alternate ANSI median increased 1.21% but its median paired ratio changed -0.51%, with three pairs slower. Alternate Unicode median increased 0.54% but its median paired ratio was only +0.006%.",
    "Primary ASCII, ANSI and short-line throughput had lower medians; short lines were slower in four pairs. Primary Unicode was slower in one pair despite a higher median.",
    "PTY throughput and DSR RTT measure processing/protocol response, not frame presentation, visual correctness or input-to-photon latency.",
    "Equal cells and configurations do not establish Unicode grapheme or fallback rendering equivalence.",
    "This is not a competitor ranking or a measurement on an actual Omarchy/Hyprland machine with a physical GPU and monitor.",
    "Executable and artifact ZIP hashes are CI records; their original bytes are not retained here for independent rehashing. Source provenance comes from workflow/build records, not from verifying machine code against source.",
    "The standalone runner reports source_refs_verified_by_runner=false. Exact revisions and archives are verified through the CI workflow, refs, Cargo inputs and root-build log observations.",
